superl8
=======

W8A8 (INT8) DP4A FlashAttention-2 kernels for NVIDIA Volta (sm_70) / CMP 100-210,
packaged as a PyTorch custom-op library. BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2026 superl8 authors.

Attributions
------------

* Kernel structure and device-helper conventions follow ai-bond/flash-attention-v100
  (https://github.com/ai-bond/flash-attention-v100). The int8 quantization recipe is
  informed by (never copied from) SDNQ and SageAttention.

* The 3-bit Lloyd-Max KV-cache quantizer (`superl8/quant/lloydmax.py`, "TQ3") is adapted
  from qengine (https://github.com/Haru-neo/qengine), Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c)
  Haru-neo — specifically `src/turboquant.cuh`'s block-L2-norm + fixed-Gaussian
  Lloyd-Max codebook recipe. superl8 adapts only the scalar quantizer and builds it on
  top of the KV path's EXISTING Hadamard rotation (`superl8/quant/rotation.py`); qengine's
  Walsh-Hadamard transform is not reimplemented. Per Apache-2.0 §4 the adaptation
  carries qengine's attribution in-file. qengine ships no NOTICE file of its own.
